WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
In the future, we will all have the option&nbsp;
of having our stem cells banked ahead of time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:11.320
so that any time you need new neurons, 
new muscle&nbsp;cells, new skin cells,

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.535
they'd be generated from this bank.

00:00:13.535 --> 00:00:18.000
I realized that instead of doing this&nbsp;
tedious process of stem cell culture by hand,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.682
we could use lasers to remove
 the unwanted cells.

00:00:21.682 --> 00:00:24.107
Take some blood cells, put it in a cassette.

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:28.141
Add chemicals to those blood cells 
to turn them into&nbsp;stem cells like always.

00:00:28.141 --> 00:00:34.102
The machine identifies the unwanted 
cells and zaps them with a laser.

00:00:34.102 --> 00:00:38.634
After repeated pruning, you end up with 
a perfect culture of your stem cells,

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:41.671
ready to be banked&nbsp;and used at any time.

00:00:41.671 --> 00:00:43.316
With this technology,

00:00:43.316 --> 00:00:47.248
we can finally realize the true 
potential of stem cells:

00:00:47.248 --> 00:00:52.500
on-demand functional cures 
made from your cells.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:56.197
Cures that your body won't reject.

00:00:56.197 --> 00:00:59.684
Cures that truly work for everyone.

